{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_coordinatedshutdown", "label": "CoordinatedShutdown", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Production shutdown has ordering requirements \u2014 leave the cluster before stopping the sharding region, stop the HTTP server before the actors that serve it \u2014 so tasks register against named phases the framework runs in dependency order."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_phases", "label": "The 12 canonical phases", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Empty phases are no-ops, so only phases with registered tasks do anything. Phase 8 waits for nothing: cluster.leave is a single best-effort broadcast with no leader-sequenced removal to await."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_shutdowntask", "label": "ShutdownTask", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tasks within one phase run concurrently and the phase waits for the last one; ordering inside a phase means splitting into two phases with dependsOn."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_reason", "label": "Shutdown Reason classes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lets a task branch on why shutdown was triggered; being downed by the cluster does not start the pipeline by itself, so ClusterDowningReason exists for a run() you make yourself."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_customphase", "label": "Custom phases and dependsOn", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "dependsOn makes the order DAG-shaped rather than linear, and because every entry must name an already-registered phase a cycle cannot be formed in the first place."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_phasetimeout", "label": "Phase timeouts and recover", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every task is wrapped in a timeout race; recover:true continues to the next phase while recover:false halts the pipeline mid-flight."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_processhooks", "label": "installProcessHooks / removeProcessHooks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Calling either twice is harmless and removeProcessHooks never touches a listener it did not install, so a second ActorSystem in the same process is left alone."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_k8sprestop", "label": "Kubernetes PreStop integration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The sleep in PreStop gives the load balancer time to drop the pod from rotation before the actor system starts shutting down, so in-flight requests never see a draining node."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_idempotentrun", "label": "run() is idempotent", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Multiple independent triggers all reach the same in-flight promise; the first starts the pipeline and the rest await the same completion."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_draintimeoutnesting", "label": "Nested drain and phase budgets", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The drain sits inside the last phase, so the inner budget must be the smaller \u2014 raise the drain above the phase timeout and the phase is abandoned before a single actor has been told to stop."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_autoregistertasks", "label": "auto-register-tasks opt-out", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One switch rather than one per subsystem, because the reason to reach for it is \"I own the lifecycle\", never \"unbind the HTTP server but leave the brokers to me\"."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_coordinatedshutdown", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_actor_system_terminate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_processhooks", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_actor_system_rununtilterminated", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_draintimeoutnesting", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_actor_system_shutdowndraintimeout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_coordinatedshutdown", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_phases", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_coordinatedshutdown", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_shutdowntask", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_shutdowntask", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_reason", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/fundamentals/coordinated-shutdown.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_customphase", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_fundamentals_coordinated_shutdown_phases", "relation": "refe